[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0010","text":"雏菜酱\n今天愿意陪我来，谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0020","text":"嘿～\n雏菜是因为想来才来的哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0030","text":"因为这家的甜点，看起来超好吃的嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0040","text":"这、这样啊……\n那我先去拿本书"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0050","text":"嗯～！\n去吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0060","text":"嗯～，好好吃～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200400_04_0100","text":"啊哈～\n看得好认真～"}]
